    "enUS": {
      "description": "Whatever Kaldorei knowledge you seek will not be found among these ruins, {class}. Not anymore.\r\n\r\nHowever, while the physical lies in ruin, the spiritual remains.\r\n\r\nSeek the guardian spirits of Azshara, the Hinterlands, and Feralas. You will know them by their shrines. Prove yourself to them, and heed their words. Their wisdom will be passed on to you, so that it will not be lost to time as so much was here.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Guardian of Feralas",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Guardian of the Hinterlands",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Guardian of Azshara",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Prove yourself to the guardian spirits of Feralas, Azshara, and the Hinterlands, then return to Tyrisius in Feralas.",
      "title": "Wisdom of the Guardians",
